tern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","title":"Swami","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/swami","kind":"symbol","type":"topic"}}}